# OptionsSymbian.cmake -- the `Symbian` WebKit port. Copied to
# Source/cmake/ by webkit/apply_patches.sh. JSC exactly as the JSCOnly build (CLoop, no JIT, static, system malloc, generic run
# loop -- the WTF/JSC/bmalloc Platform files include the JSCOnly ones, which carry our seams), plus WebCore + PAL on curl/mbedTLS,
# Skia (CPU raster), HarfBuzz/FreeType/ICU. No WebKit2, no WebKitLegacy (both multi-process or Apple-only upstream): the
# embedding is our (phwebview). No PLATFORM() name is defined: code paths are chosen by USE()/ENABLE() only.
#
# Libraries are INTERFACE targets carrying include dirs only: nothing here links (static archives; the E32 emitter does the final
# link, package step). Paths: PH_DEPS (build_webdeps.sh), PH_ICU, PH_MBEDTLS_SRC / PH_MBEDTLS_CFG (the tls
# layer's mbedTLS, only for the unused alternative TLS backend).

find_package(Threads REQUIRED)
